source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: Only the last `\\` run of a token breaks: Jira shows the first pair and breaks on the second, and jiro reads two literal backslashes and one hard break.
-- input.jira --
ab\\cd\\ef
-- rendered.html --
<p>ab\\cd<br class="atl-forced-newline" />ef</p>
-- want.md --
ab\\\\cd\
ef
-- warnings.json --
[]
